{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $30-6v-18w$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}30-6v-18w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{30-6v-18w}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{30}{2}-\\dfrac{6v}{2}-\\dfrac{18w}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(15-3v-9w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nWe see that $30-6v-18w$ is equivalent to $2(15-3v-9w)$, not to $2(15-12v)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $3$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}30-6v-18w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{30-6v-18w}{3}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{30}{3}-\\dfrac{6v}{3}-\\dfrac{18w}{3}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3(10-2v-6w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $30-6v-18w$ is *not* equivalent to $3(10-3v+6w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $6$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}30-6v-18w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{30-6v-18w}{6}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{30}{6}-\\dfrac{6v}{6}-\\dfrac{18w}{6}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6(5-v-3w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $30-6v-18w$ is equivalent to $6(5-v-3w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $30-6v-18w$:\n\n- $6(5-v-3w)$\n- $2(15-3v-9w)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $30-6v-18w$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $30-24v$.","content":"$2(15-12v)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $30-9v+18w$.","content":"$3(10-3v+6w)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $30-6v-18w$.","content":"$6(5-v-3w)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $30-6v-18w$.","content":"$2(15-3v-9w)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
